name: sim.getJointMaxForce
description:
luaSynopsis: float forceOrTorque=sim.getJointMaxForce(int jointHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float forceOrTorque=sim.getJointMaxForce(int jointHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
